exam_text.ro:
- FSM Moore: LED-urile depind de starea curentă.
- Modul automat folosește timer; modul manual folosește buton.

Tabel de stări/parametri:
state | output | next_auto
--- | --- | ---
GREEN | LED verde ON | YELLOW după 5 s
YELLOW | LED galben ON | RED după 1 s
RED | LED roșu ON | GREEN după 5 s

Pseudocod logic comentat:
setup()
{
    init_button()
    init_traffic_LEDs()
    init_timer()
    init_serial_STDIO()

    mode = AUTO
    state = GREEN
    state_time = now()
}

loop()
{
    if (button_pressed())                  // comutare mod automat/manual
        toggle(mode)

    // Ieșiri FSM Moore: depind de starea curentă
    if (state == GREEN)  set_LEDs(green=ON,  yellow=OFF, red=OFF)
    if (state == YELLOW) set_LEDs(green=OFF, yellow=ON,  red=OFF)
    if (state == RED)    set_LEDs(green=OFF, yellow=OFF, red=ON)

    if (mode == AUTO)
    {
        if (state == GREEN  && elapsed(state_time) >= 5 s) change_state(YELLOW)
        if (state == YELLOW && elapsed(state_time) >= 1 s) change_state(RED)
        if (state == RED    && elapsed(state_time) >= 5 s) change_state(GREEN)
    }
    else                                    // mod manual
    {
        if (button_pressed_long())
            change_state(next_state(state))
    }

    Serial_print("State = ", state, " Mode = ", mode)
}

