exam_text.ro:
- FSM-ul are stare inițială STANDBY.
- Raportarea pe serial este ieșirea principală.

Tabel de stări/parametri:
state | event | next | output
--- | --- | --- | ---
STANDBY | buton | DOOR_CLOSED | Serial STANDBY
DOOR_CLOSED | buton/contact open | DOOR_OPEN | Serial USA INCHISA
DOOR_OPEN | buton/contact closed | DOOR_CLOSED | Serial USA DESCHISA

Pseudocod logic comentat:
setup()
{
    init_button()
    init_door_contact()
    init_serial_STDIO()

    state = STANDBY
}

loop()
{
    button = read_button()
    door_open = read_door_contact()

    // Tranziții FSM
    if (state == STANDBY && button == PRESSED)
        state = DOOR_CLOSED

    else if (state == DOOR_CLOSED && door_open == TRUE)
        state = DOOR_OPEN

    else if (state == DOOR_OPEN && door_open == FALSE)
        state = DOOR_CLOSED

    // Ieșirea sistemului: raportare serială
    if (state == STANDBY)
        Serial_print("STANDBY")
    else if (state == DOOR_CLOSED)
        Serial_print("USA INCHISA")
    else if (state == DOOR_OPEN)
        Serial_print("USA DESCHISA")

    wait(50 ms)
}

